\newlabel{tab:media}{{4}{7}{Block-device reads per call on the owner hosts (the coordinator\textquoteright s SSD for Native), from \texttt {/proc/diskstats} at the measurement gates. Zero means every read came from memory. One means a device read for each call. Live reads cover data written during the run}{table.caption.9}{}}
